---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { CREDENTIALS, ORG } from '../consts';

const crumbs = [{ href: '/about/', label: 'About' }];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Paws In The Sky"
  description="Paws In The Sky is a Tampa pet flight nanny service, a division of Crossroads Tech & Travel Group, registered with the USDA as an animal transporter."
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="About" title="A small, Tampa-based pet courier" crumbs={crumbs}
    lede="Paws In The Sky is run by Sam Johnson, who does the flying, as part of Crossroads Tech & Travel Group." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>
        We started flying pets because the alternative, a crate in the cargo hold, was what most families
        were being offered, and it isn’t what anyone wants for a ten-week-old puppy. A person in the seat above
        the carrier changes the whole trip.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of our work brings puppies and kittens from breeders to new families in other states.
        The rest is families moving, and pets whose people can’t make the trip themselves.
      </p>

      <h2>Credentials</h2>
      <ul class="checks">
        {CREDENTIALS.usdaCertificate && <li>Registered with the USDA, APHIS Animal Care, as a carrier: Class T certificate <strong>{CREDENTIALS.usdaCertificate}</strong>.</li>}
        <li>Also registered as an intermediate handler (Class H){CREDENTIALS.usdaClassH && <>: certificate <strong>{CREDENTIALS.usdaClassH}</strong></>}.</li>
        {CREDENTIALS.liabilityInsurance && <li>{CREDENTIALS.liabilityInsurance} of liability insurance.</li>}
        <li>A division of {ORG.parent}, a Florida corporation.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The rest of the family</h2>
      <p>
        Crossroads Tech &amp; Travel Group also runs <a href="https://crossroadstravel.co/">Crossroads Travel</a>,
        a travel agency. If you are moving and need flights for the people as well as the pets, we can plan both.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        {ORG.phone && <>Call or text <a href={`tel:${ORG.phoneHref}`}>{ORG.phone}</a>, or email </>}
        <a href={`mailto:${ORG.email}`}>{ORG.email}</a>. We’re based in {ORG.city}, {ORG.region}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
